OL,3,GNEWSAPressure group calls to reopen
OL,4,Arail link
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rail pressure group is calling on
OL,7,FHerefordshire and other authorities to
OL,8,Fwork together on making the case for a
OL,9,Freopened
OL,10,FHereford/Ross-on-Wye/Gloucester railway
OL,11,Flink.
OL,13,FThe British Regional Transport
OL,14,FAssociation (BRTA) claim the link,
OL,15,Fwhich closed in the 1960s, is
OL,16,F"strategic and brimming with
OL,17,Fpotential".
OL,19,FThey believe it offers wider
OL,20,Fconnections northwards to Shrewsbury,
OL,21,Fand connections to Reading and London
OL,22,Fto the east.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
